==Icelandic==
{{cardinalbox|is|9|10|11|níu|ellefu|ord=tíundi}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|is|non|tíu}}, from {{der|is|gem-pro|*tehun||ten}}, from {{der|is|ine-pro|*déḱm̥||ten}}. Cognate with Faroese ''[[tíggju]]'', Swedish {{m|sv|tio}}, Danish {{m|da|ti}} and English ''[[ten]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈtiːʏ/}}

===Numeral===
{{head|is|numeral}}

# [[ten]]; the cardinal number after {{m|is|níu||nine}} and before {{m|is|ellefu||eleven}}.

